	)
	(text "1S LiPo backup: charger, boost, ideal-diode ORing into both 5 V rails"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.0 3.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "85b3df73-07cb-5361-be89-abf6f583c2e0")
	)
	(text "Keeps both MCUs, CAN and the analog guard alive through cranking / IMA-restart dips so a dropout is reported (SG4) and recovery is clean. The relay coils are NOT backed up on purpose: 12 V loss = pass-through. Charger input is +5V0_A_SRC (ahead of the ideal diode), so backup power cannot loop back into the charger. Pack must have its own PCM; charge window 0-45 C via the on-board NTC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c94c4daa-2ee3-586d-aef6-bd9731977e84")
	)
	(text "Battery connector, PTC, monitors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.0 48.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d12d866c-8171-52dd-99d9-dc517d0f549a")
	)
	(text "Charger MCP73833 (1S Li-ion, ~210 mA, thermistor window)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.0 102.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "21e478d6-990c-57e2-9b5d-487c793b8ab9")
	)
	(text "Boost TPS61092 (fixed 5.0 V) and low-battery flag"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.0 154.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6d1e4690-5842-5cab-afe1-cc8371d132ee")
	)
	(text "Boost overvoltage cutoff (SM-24): a boost fault must not reach both 5 V rails"
